                    "text": "EXPORT NAME: br.delay.digital.1.1~\nMax External Export asks for a name: keep the ~ at the end. Without it the external has the same name as the abstraction br.delay.digital.1.1, and Max loads whichever it finds first. Audio Plugin Export (VST3/AU): any name; the Mode, Time_L, Time_R, Xfade, Feedback, Route, Hold, Low_Cut, High_Cut, Dry_Wet and On_Off params appear in your DAW."
                }
